  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic:** (First number - Third number) ÷ 3 = Second number.**\n\n**For, **(100, 30, 10)\n\n⇒ (100 - 10) ÷ 3 = 30\n\n⇒ 90 ÷ 3 = 30\n\n⇒ 30 = 30.\n\n**For, **(250, 60, 70)\n\n⇒ (250 - 70) ÷ 3 = 60\n\n⇒ 180 ÷ 3 = 60\n\n⇒ 60 = 60\n\nLet's check with options:\n\nOption 1) (700, 220, 40)\n\n⇒ (700 - 40) ÷ 3 = 220\n\n​⇒ 660 ÷ 3 = 220\n\n​⇒ 220 = 220.\n\nHere, logic followed.\n\nOption 2) (240, 187, 104)\n\n⇒ (240 - 104) ÷ 3 = 187\n\n​⇒ 136 ÷ 3 = 187\n\n​⇒ 45 ≠ 187\n\nOption 3) (209, 122, 109)\n\n⇒ (209 - 109) ÷ 3 = 122\n\n​⇒ 100 ÷ 3 =122\n\n​⇒ 33 ≠ 122.\n\nOption 4) (310, 198, 30)\n\n⇒ (310 - 30) ÷ 3 = 198\n\n​⇒ 280 ÷ 3 = 198\n\n​⇒ 93.3 ≠ 198.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 1\".**\n\n67:T1081,\n<",
